                    468.0,
                    274.0
                ],
                [
                    29.0,
                    274.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. The party requesting arbitration shall then assume the responsibility of procuring the services of the arbitrator in accordance with the procedures of the American Arbitration Association. The arbitrator shall thereafter hear and decide the issue as soon as possible, and shall submit his Award in the case.",
            "block_bbox": [
                29,
